<div class="min-h-screen bg-[#0a0e1a] text-white px-8 py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <a href="/" class="text-green-400 hover:underline mb-8 block">← Back to SoccerTracker</a>
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-black mb-2" style="font-family: Georgia, serif;">Support</h1>
  <p class="text-white/50 mb-8">We're here to help!</p>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
    <section class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">📧 Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For any questions, bug reports, or feature requests:</p>
      <p class="text-green-400 text-lg font-bold mt-2">support@soccertracker.app</p>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-2">We typically respond within 24-48 hours.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">How do I log a training session?</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm mt-1">Go to Sessions → New Session and fill in the details.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">How do I invite players to my team?</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm mt-1">Go to Teams → your team → Invite a Player. Enter their email and generate an invite link.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">How do I delete my account?</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm mt-1">Email us at support@soccertracker.app and we'll delete your account within 30 days.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">Is SoccerTracker free?</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm mt-1">Yes! SoccerTracker is completely free to use.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">🔒 Privacy</h2>
      <p>Read our <a href="/privacy" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> to learn how we handle your data.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>